{%- comment -%}
  Designer price display, port of the FM theme's snippet of the same name (federicomahora.co).
  Amount in the VISITOR's currency cents: product metafield custom.original_retail_price is a money field and
  Shopify Markets already converts it in Liquid (`.value | times: 1` = cart-currency cents, see the note in
  sections/pm-bundle-save.liquid), so Liquid prints the final text and no script is needed. FM stores USD cents
  and converts in its assets/pm-designer-price.js; that file is not needed on this store.
  Whole amounts drop ".00" like FM ("$245", "€220"). Nothing renders when the amount is blank or 0.

  Accepts:
  - cents {Number} designer amount in cart-currency cents (required)
  - strike {Boolean} wrap in <s> (struck-through designer price)
  - class {String} optional extra class

  Usage:
  {% render 'pm-designer-price', cents: 24952, strike: true %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign dp_cents = cents | default: 0 | round
  assign dp_text = ''
  if dp_cents > 0
    assign dp_text = dp_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  endif
-%}
{%- if dp_text != blank -%}
  <span class="pm-designer-price{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">
    {%- if strike -%}<s>{{ dp_text }}</s>{%- else -%}{{ dp_text }}{%- endif -%}
  </span>
{%- endif -%}
